+  /// - [focusOutline]: Whether to show focus outline. Defaults to `true`
+  /// - [enableFeedback]: Whether to enable haptic/audio feedback. Defaults to `true`
+  /// - [onTapDown], [onTapUp], [onTapCancel]: Primary tap gesture callbacks
